Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Abbadon\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Abbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is a Knight of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是不得已而为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 你决定骗我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?You decided to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那只精神病天使附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to be possessed by some psycho angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会作为副手加入你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will join you as the second in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.35,0:00:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你要干掉的第一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the first name on your to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我救了Sam 你们就还我自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I save Sam, I leave here a free man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制主动权 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take control, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人因为我而受了伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought of if somebody else get hurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种想法让我一辈子心都不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin的死都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's blood is on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲手杀了那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will end that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.04,0:00:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.91,0:00:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会拦着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:59.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（碧玉泉 密西西比 1863年）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,守好你的岗位 不要轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand in your ground no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不顾一切保护骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Knight must be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.86,0:02:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个色色的笑是献给我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that blue smile for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,先给我买杯喝的如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just buy me a drink first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.68,0:02:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 等我再看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said that the next time I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是死人一个 是啊 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead, yes rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不要在这儿动手 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's not do it in a bar, shall we.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会从这儿查到什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bar is a bust.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边的女服务生倒是跟吸血鬼有一腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that waitress is troubled with the capital VD.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.46,0:02:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你的猎物 Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your pray, Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就不知道去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has left the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候考虑下一个重大事宜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to move on to a more impressing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.67,0:02:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 毁了Abbadon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like destroying Abbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士可不是那么容易就杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Knight of Hell ain't exactly the dying kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有一件东西能杀死骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something can kill a Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:03:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大天使们有一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weapon the archangels used to execute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在能杀你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I kill you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找那把匕首已经好久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been chasing that blade for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一次我差点儿就得手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closest I've got to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人 Smitty\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was when one of my drews Smitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.41,0:03:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说Abbadon手下的一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got wind of a protage demon of Abbadon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道初刃的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who claimed the acknowledgement of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾的是 在Smitty下手之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, before Smitty could nap the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫John Winchester的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hunter by the name of John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,先他一步做掉了那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nap the protege.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你 是为了看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,John Winchester的那本日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything of the John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能把线索引到初刃上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memorio bible might lead us to the First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就能杀死Abbadon了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill Abbadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟我一起猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna hunt with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.45,0:03:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢有个搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do love a good buddy company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.60,0:04:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干掉了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah he picked up the protege.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.46,0:04:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟Abaddon不对头的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who had bones with Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all about it is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些数字和符号是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are those numbers and marks mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.59,0:04:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在欲擒故纵吗 是蒙太奇手法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You playing hard to get?A time for montage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's code.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的储藏柜之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of my dad's story lockers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了以防万一 他把东西藏在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made something by the case there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.85,0:04:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,数字旁边那个T是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that T next to the numbers mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就去老爸的小窝里翻翻看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go find daddy's man cave, shall we.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我怎么知道这不是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do I know this isn't a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是有意思的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what makes it fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝起来像 分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tastes like…molecules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我是人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了生存 我必须吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I had to eat constantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点儿小烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, kind of annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.31,0:05:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 很多人类的事儿都挺烦人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a lot of human things are pretty annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我享受食物的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…I enjoy the taste of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是花生酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Particularly peanut butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有葡萄果冻 不是果酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grape jelly, not jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,果酱不容易被消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jam I found unsettling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在尝不出花生酱果冻了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you can't taste PB&J.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 只是我现在尝到了每个分子的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I…I taste every molecule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是整体的味道 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sum of its parts, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,味道太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想念你们 花生酱果冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, PB&J.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:05:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要继续你的治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to continue your healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.05,0:06:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.58,0:06:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不擅长撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrible liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们兄弟俩骗的团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}And betrayed both you and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.37,0:06:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay it's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 到底出什么事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I notice something it's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身体里有东西产生了共鸣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's resonated inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,与天使有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something angelic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该给Dean打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should call Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想走就叫他走好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted to go and he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿不要叫上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.24,0:06:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有必要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is all this really necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好歹也在你弟身体里待过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I've been inside your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.69,0:06:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是沾亲带故呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're practically family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.97,0:07:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你与我跟亲人这个词差了十万八千里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the furthest thing from family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗老混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that dickbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是来猎魔的吗 我们现在就开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you wanna hunt, let's hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这儿待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来 你们这种装修风格叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you call this decor anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,乡巴佬强迫症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rustic obsessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,多疑症患者室内布置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paranoid deco.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,目测我爸抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like my dad was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abbadon的小罗喽的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working with another hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.45,0:07:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,正跟另一个猎人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he nabbed Abbadon's pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.26,0:07:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那个T不是指世界第一废柴老爹喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess the T didn't stand for terrible father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它代表了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stood for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.37,0:07:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tara\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他们审讯了一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they interrogated a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后驱逐了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they exorcise him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是恶魔交待了有关初刃的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not before he mentioned the First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it when I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的文件都是空白的 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of the file was empty, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人霍格沃茨难道不教你们如何记好笔记吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't they teach note taking in the hunters Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找Tara看她是不是还活着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go see if Tara's still kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面描述了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a detail about when.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使离开容器之后的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels leave their vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是这样 这是天使语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think, it's…Enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,写得文绉绉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which can be a bit flowery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃之亦留\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the departed shall remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,留之为弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the remains shall be the departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以天使离开容器的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when angels leave their vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有一部分留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They leave behind a piece of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如就像 天使的指纹之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a…like an angelic fingerprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你想怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you wanna call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,被留下的那一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}This piece of the departed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有残余的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contains grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 我身体里还有天使残存的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that there's an angelic grace inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你治疗一次 它的力量就减弱一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's fading each time I heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.27,0:08:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好事儿还是坏事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, is that good or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是无害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.53,0:08:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这一部分荣光或许能帮到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grace itself might be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这份资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.47,0:09:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们或许可以用你身体里的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We maybe able to use the grace that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪到Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remains inside you to track Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能提取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can extract it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.89,0:09:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Painfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者们相信有了荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Men of Letters believed that you could perform a.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能制造一个追踪咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking spell with the extracted grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们从来没有证实过可行性\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were never able to test the theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为他们没有小白鼠 不过我们正好有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they didn't have a guinea pig, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候养了只小白鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是小白鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道那东西在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea with where that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是Tara吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,牌子上就是这么写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what the sign says.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能有所帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,John Winchester 有印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester, ring a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:09:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是Sam还是Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Sam or Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.85,0:10:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是长成个俊俏模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, didn't you grow up pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在干你们的家庭事业吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still in the family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 从小就被教育出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, born and raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,说正事 几年以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, bunch of years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.94,0:10:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我爸一起猎过魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worked a job with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.82,0:10:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的 呃 同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me and my, uh, associate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从92年开始 只要我周围有恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since 92 I get a painful little tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的膝盖就会一阵痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}In what's left in my knee whatever a demon is around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是猎人 多么相互信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters, so trusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.87,0:10:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩谈吧 我去买杯拿铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go grab a latte while you get this sorted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条仿波斯毯底下画着恶魔陷阱呢 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's trap under the knock-off Persian, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tara\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我的 同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, my…uh associate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是好哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besties, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.57,0:10:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm the King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩之所以在一起肯定事出有因\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason why we're working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我管那叫恶魔附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧见没 我没被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.52,0:11:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他确实是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他在帮我忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's helping me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping you with what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我老爹曾经捉住过一只恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and my old man found a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它知道初刃的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knew something about the First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要那把匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find that blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟John一样有着漂亮的脸蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are as handsome as John.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你也想找那把匕首 那你就和他一样蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as dumb too if you're looking for that old relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在追杀一个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hunting a Knight of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 他们不都死光了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个恶魔说大天使们有一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon said the archangels used a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以杀死地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could kill the Knights of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们从没听说过什么地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd never heard of anything like the Knights of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说是初刃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爹觉得他在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad thought he was lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了逃过杀身之祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to save himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就驱逐了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你老爹度过了愉快的一周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we had a lovely weekend together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就分道扬镳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we went our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我对那个匕首念念不忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I could never let the blade go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道那种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,能对猎人帮上很大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could really give a hunter an edge you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四处寻找线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的膝盖和我这辈子作为代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroyed my knee and my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后我找到了什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,初刃的坐标咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}A location spell for the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.61,0:12:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我永远都无法完成这个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I could never finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一样材料凑不齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't find one ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,挪威海怪的精髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Essence of Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,挪威海怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在伯利兹有一仓库的挪威海怪收藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a warehouse full of Kraken essence in Belize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏掉这个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.69,0:12:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在你们说presto之前就能跑个来回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be there and back before you say presto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Presto\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你们 Dean你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和我一样想要Abaddon死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants Abaddon as dead as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你老爹知道你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your daddy could see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.46,0:12:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使那个什么初刃真的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, even if that blade is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不值得你跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't worth being.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:12:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王勾肩搭背\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bosom buddies with the King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能杀死Abaddon 没有什么不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon?Way worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这事儿过了我再解决Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll deal with Crowley after.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.35,0:13:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你老爹听起来一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound just like your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他说要打给我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he said he'd call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.29,0:13:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,能开始了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,密苏里州 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missouri, figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要加入我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you care to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 随时可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him?Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.56,0:14:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会需要这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dealing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到了一股黑暗的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel something dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 比你还黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, darker than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to leave here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你对密封过敏还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you allergic to bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是个养蜂人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a beekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谋杀之父\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the father of murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, who.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:14:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cain\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说Cain和Abel那个Cain\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in Cain and Abel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须马上离开这儿 离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to be a world away from here, from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们哪儿也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不直接飞出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just zap out out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不会放下我的伙伴不管的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never leave my domestic partner in crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的就好像你突然性情大变了似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like your heart grew three sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出不去 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't zap out of here, can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.61,0:15:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cain对我有影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain's doing something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来今天不适合你跑路啊 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your day for getaway, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我Cain的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so tell me about this Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cain把Abel杀了之后 就变成了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the Cain killed Abel and became a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 变成了恶魔 是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean became a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他变成了不死的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he became the deadliest demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地球上游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}To walk the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.44,0:15:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,残杀万千\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好的堕落成最邪恶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best being the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.57,0:16:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he just.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都以为他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least hoped he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.83,0:16:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩有谁养过蜂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do either of you keep bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有益于身心放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜蜂 多么高尚的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're such noble creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.00,0:16:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们产的蜂蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都留在了蜂房上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I keep it right on the comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dying, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了蜜蜂 人类到头来只有一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without bees, mankind will cease to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.15,0:16:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Winchester来我家干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Winchester doing at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然退休了 但是还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm retired.I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.62,0:16:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is why are you looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}More importantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是如何找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 呃 有个小故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it's a…funny story really.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.73,0:16:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一点点的误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:16:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要教我这招儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna teach me how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿的目的是什么 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找一件武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.48,0:17:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大天使用来杀地狱骑士的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangel uses to kill the knights of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要干掉一个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needed it to kill a knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我懂 你退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I get it.You're retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是来破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here to get between.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你恶魔式的退休生活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and the demonic AARP.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.07,0:17:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但外面情况很乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's bad out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在找赢的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just looking the even of odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是初刃的坐标咒语把我们引到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The location spell was for the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语只能生效一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One time deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人知道你们在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else knew you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你有没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder if you might have seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我的朋友经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of my friends pass through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.63,0:18:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,长着奇怪的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of funny ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴有人拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been a pleasure having company.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一百年里有一次也就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once a century is enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,出门不送\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can let yourselves out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.59,0:18:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey listen pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没拿到初刃我们不会走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving here without the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 你的名声我听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a quite reputation, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看到了你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the part of you being brave rings true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what can I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是对一件事件紧咬不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an all-in kinda guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon是最后一个地狱骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon is the last knight of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你早就什么都不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're out of game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她死了 你也无所谓吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you care if she dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的朋友能说话 他会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your friend can talk, he could tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士是我亲自训练的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I trained the knights of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己亲手建立起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built that demonic order.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔军队 包括Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my own hands, Abaddon included.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这种消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,5分钟之前你就该说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've used five minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一些事你朋友不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's something your friend doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实除了Abaddon以外没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That no one knows in fact, outside Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱骑士其实不是大天使杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't the archangel that slaughtered the knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么突然杀同族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you turn on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很欣赏你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, I admired your bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.83,0:19:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去城里办点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have errands to run into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.03,0:19:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是愉快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.05,0:19:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们能出国逃命了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we leave the country now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 初刃是我们唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the first blade was our.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.34,0:19:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死Abaddon的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only shot to kill Abaddon, this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又是离成功最近的一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The closest you've been to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能听听话 一次也行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you listen to reason, for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.03,0:19:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他要进城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he said he was going into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.51,0:19:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.65,0:19:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他一走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait till he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就闯进去 拿走东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back, bust it, take what's ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 我能问你一个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, may I ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.03,0:19:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我能再问你一个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 严格来说 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically…yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,问吧 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 试炼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.88,0:20:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完成试炼 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to go through with them for a reason, didn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择 活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是牺牲自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather than to sacrifice yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.34,0:20:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们选择对方 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You chose each other - Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.67,0:20:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 Dean替我做了一次选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, Dean made a choice for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dean所做的 - 他做了什么已经不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What Dean did - Doesn't matter what Dean did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以阻止一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I could have stopped all this Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.63,0:20:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来可以关上地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have closed the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean自己走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's gone, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这一切都算在我的头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is on me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.27,0:20:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我找到Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can find Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就还有扭转的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,做为一个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就意味着要及时还债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means settling your debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起平衡收支吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start balance the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.93,0:21:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is by far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止 你做过最蠢的决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dumbest thing you've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.44,0:21:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说还太早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.09,0:21:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…it's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.24,0:21:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame.Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.13,0:21:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 好好的开始找行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sack up and start looking okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对不会相信Winchester和Crowley发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd never believe what Winchester and Crowley found.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,求支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有人都派过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就要开始疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come to the part where it actually hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.29,0:22:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开始提取了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna begin the extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.13,0:22:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it working.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要扎深一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to push the needle in deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,施这个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more grace in order to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast this about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.01,0:22:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sam 如果我不小心 - 靠 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, if I get too close - Damn it, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.56,0:22:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别废话 快做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.91,0:22:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.19,0:22:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身体正在恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body is regressing to the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:22:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel附身之前的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was in before Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有足够的荣光了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have enough grace for summoning spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底有没有 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we or not, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.21,0:23:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.93,0:23:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,连A片都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.33,0:23:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can figure out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.07,0:23:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐姓埋名了这么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went out reservation so many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有点儿苍白 她是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Plain?Who is she.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.24,0:23:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cain手上有相同的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain had a similar ring on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀之父成家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father of murder got hitched.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.55,0:23:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gorgeous, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:23:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose that was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:23:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.69,0:23:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we can't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友Tara帮了我们很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend Tara was very helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got downright chatty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.71,0:24:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我剥了她的皮之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I peeled all her skin off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.63,0:24:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想惹麻烦Cain\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want any trouble, Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.67,0:24:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你交出那个所谓的地狱之王和Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want so called King and the Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.57,0:24:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要讨好我的新主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a new master to impress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那两个家伙正好够用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm betting bagging those two will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.86,0:24:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.30,0:24:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.95,0:24:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This lot all need to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.15,0:24:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在门上做的手脚能把我们关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whammy you put out the door keeps us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.77,0:24:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把他们挡在外面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can it keep them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.47,0:24:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.81,0:24:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找东西把门堵上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna barricade the entrances.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.58,0:24:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ready for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.15,0:24:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.00,0:24:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你暴露了我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You exposed my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.51,0:24:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴露了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You exposed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.70,0:24:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, boohoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.10,0:24:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有勇气但是很讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave but repulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.35,0:24:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是如别人所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You truly have adopted your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.24,0:24:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你就有点儿名不副实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say you've lived up to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.73,0:24:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.63,0:24:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.45,0:24:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.38,0:24:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.46,0:25:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,共享最后一餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}For last meal I leave this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就会彻底消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I disappeared again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.13,0:25:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也只能做到这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.98,0:25:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.76,0:25:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.69,0:25:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.99,0:25:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么Winchester总是把自己往死路上逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why must the Winchesters run towards death.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.95,0:25:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.51,0:25:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.84,0:25:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 在我 还是人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, when I…was human.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死过 那份经历让我知道生命的可贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I died, that showed me life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.19,0:25:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命是必须用尽全力去保护的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it must be protected by all causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.69,0:25:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.19,0:25:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你的生活和Winchester一样糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is pigheaded as Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.91,0:25:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活比你们任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life's not worse any more than.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.42,0:25:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.89,0:25:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是你 还是Dean 还是Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yours, or Dean's, or Kevin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.93,0:25:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.86,0:25:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我做一件对的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me do one thing right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.12,0:26:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.08,0:26:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.03,0:26:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is your play.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.70,0:26:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.36,0:26:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么就弄不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I not getting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.78,0:26:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不像是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's not like you're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.63,0:26:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,从什么时候开始 伟大的Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when does the great Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.25,0:26:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始求人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.97,0:26:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来可不像是我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't sound like the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,厕所墙上的故事里读到的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read about on demon bathroom walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.50,0:26:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你落了一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you've lost a step.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.12,0:26:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.73,0:26:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.08,0:26:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们玩儿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.66,0:27:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.27,0:27:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.08,0:27:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会儿不应该过了你的上床时间了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it past your bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.72,0:27:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.00,0:27:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但老子是Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.08,0:28:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 你在考验我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?Some kind of a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一开始就觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt connected to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.83,0:28:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.06,0:28:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kindred spirits, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.07,0:28:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are very much alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.74,0:28:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我没杀我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except I didn't kill my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.62,0:28:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.96,0:28:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.99,0:28:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们从来不会放弃家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you never gave up on family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.50,0:28:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,永运都不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.99,0:28:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你弟弟现在在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your brother now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.27,0:28:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你耍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what kind of game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.87,0:28:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么把戏 我也不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're playing here, I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.09,0:29:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the damn blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.55,0:29:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.00,0:29:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没什么能给的出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing to hand over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.76,0:29:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I no longer have the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.85,0:29:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就不在我这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.54,0:29:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.27,0:29:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有点疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.49,0:29:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.65,0:29:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.50,0:29:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我治好了你所有的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've healed your wounds completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.83,0:29:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣光呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.08,0:29:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你体内的荣光已经没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever grace was inside you is gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.98,0:29:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel留下的全在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's left of Gadreel is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.47,0:29:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只能用现有的资源试上一试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just have to try the spell with what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.45,0:29:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.70,0:30:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 我和你一样想惩治Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I want Gadreel to pay as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.76,0:30:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有任何事值得牺牲你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing is worth losing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.79,0:30:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为人类的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being human, didn't just.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.91,0:30:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅改变了我对食物的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change my view of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.02,0:30:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也改变了我对你的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It changed my view of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.25,0:30:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在能理解 你的感受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I can relate now, of how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.62,0:30:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.74,0:30:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一一个犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person who has screwed things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.63,0:30:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你还频繁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More consistently than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.24,0:30:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.87,0:30:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我知道负罪感是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, I know what that guilt feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.47,0:30:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在知道内疚是一种什么感觉了 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what it means to feel sorry, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.20,0:30:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.05,0:30:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.45,0:30:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是以前的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the old me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.83,0:30:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会一直向前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've have just kept going.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.60,0:30:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把针一直刺到你脑子深处 直到你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would have jammed that needle in deeper until you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.22,0:31:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我为了目的总是不择手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the ends always justify the means.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.14,0:31:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我所经历的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, what I went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.33,0:31:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,花生酱果冻教会我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That PB&J taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.52,0:31:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使也能改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels can change, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.85,0:31:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.70,0:31:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许Winchester兄弟也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Winchesters can, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.16,0:31:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.54,0:31:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.57,0:31:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.81,0:31:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语把我们带到了这里 找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell brought us here, to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.26,0:31:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不会错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it has to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的咒语把你带到了初刃的力量之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your spell brought you to the source of the blade's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.58,0:31:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.86,0:31:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 现在祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.73,0:31:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是该死的Cain的印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bloody mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.92,0:31:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Lucifer亲手印下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Lucifer himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.14,0:31:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,印记和初刃同时使用才能起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark and the blade work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.48,0:32:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有印记 初任刃毫无作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the mark, the blade is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.62,0:32:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是根老骨头而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an old bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.70,0:32:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.69,0:32:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物的颌骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jaw bone, of an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.70,0:32:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用来杀死Able的颌骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A jaw bone you used to kill Abel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.92,0:32:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是上帝最宠爱的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he was God's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.88,0:32:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abel当时不是在和上帝交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abel wasn't talking to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.27,0:32:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在和Lucifer交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was talking to Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.05,0:32:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucifer会让我弟弟变成他的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was gonna make my brother into his pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.53,0:32:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法亲眼看着他堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't bear to watch him be corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.18,0:32:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我提出了一个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I offered a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.47,0:32:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂下地狱 Abel的灵魂留在天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abel soul in heaven for my soul in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.50,0:32:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lucifer接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.79,0:32:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是我亲手送Abel的灵魂上天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I was the one who sent Abel to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.59,0:32:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.08,0:32:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为了地狱的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Became a soldier of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.24,0:32:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱的骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.46,0:32:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着Lucifer让你继续送地狱的灵魂上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lucifer ordered you to make more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.32,0:32:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My knights and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.89,0:32:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做了很多令人发指的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.24,0:32:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个世纪都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}For centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.37,0:32:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带来陷入混乱和黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringers of chaos and darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.18,0:32:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你遇到了Colette\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you met Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.59,0:33:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.50,0:33:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是无条件的爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loved me unconditionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.77,0:33:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她原谅了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She forgave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.32,0:33:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只有一个要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted to ask for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.58,0:33:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.87,0:33:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑士们发现之后 开始报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the knights found out, they took retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.19,0:33:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带走了Colette\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.87,0:33:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我重新拿起初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I picked the first blade back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.91,0:33:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它再次握在手中的感觉妙不可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt so good to have it in my hands again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.96,0:33:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我杀了地狱骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I slaughtered the knights of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.25,0:33:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没杀干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.46,0:33:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.78,0:33:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Colette\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.00,0:33:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My love.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.34,0:33:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我妻子怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done to my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.12,0:33:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我 Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me, Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.47,0:33:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以挽回错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.85,0:33:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 Cain\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we, Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.96,0:33:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我们之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.62,0:33:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.86,0:33:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.14,0:34:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不当骑士 还是离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the knights, or with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.64,0:34:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.55,0:34:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不用活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so is she.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.13,0:34:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.48,0:34:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本可以永远相伴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have been forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.14,0:34:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你选择了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you chose her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.94,0:34:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不能拥有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well if I can't have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.48,0:34:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她也不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then neither can she.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.25,0:34:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢这个画面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoying the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.53,0:34:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.78,0:34:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是看得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best seat in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.16,0:34:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 Colette\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.31,0:34:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Colette 我很抱歉 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colette, I'm sorry.I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.28,0:34:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到Abaddon 然后杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will find Abaddon and I'll kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.63,0:34:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 已经有太多的杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there has been enough killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.71,0:34:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 你的生命比这些有价值得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me, you're better than all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.76,0:34:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我安葬了她之后就离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I buried her and I walked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.85,0:34:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am sorry, truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.15,0:35:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我得阻止Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to stop Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.77,0:35:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,初刃在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where is the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.26,0:35:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.73,0:35:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.50,0:35:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想开杀戒 但我没这么说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may be done with killing, but I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.17,0:35:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都不懂得放弃 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never give up on anything, do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.71,0:35:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.57,0:35:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.61,0:35:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cain\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.79,0:35:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cain\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.36,0:35:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽量拖住他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.07,0:35:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是逗人爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you a peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.37,0:35:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.31,0:35:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽全力 Colette 用你的方式看待我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried, Colette, to see myself as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.40,0:35:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.32,0:35:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.62,0:35:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你一直在守护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you watch over me, still.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.48,0:36:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我需要你无视我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to look away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.13,0:36:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.12,0:36:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底干不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in or out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.79,0:36:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我头都晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting head-spins.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.54,0:36:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把印记给你 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you the mark, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.49,0:36:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真的想要的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's what you truly want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.66,0:36:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,印记可以传给值得拥有它的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark can be transferred to someone who's worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.34,0:36:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,给和你一样的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean a killer like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.93,0:36:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.01,0:36:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以用它杀死那个贱人吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I use it to kill that bitch - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.49,0:36:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你得清楚 印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to know with the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.81,0:36:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给你带来负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes a great burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.25,0:36:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给你带来不小的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone called it a great cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.66,0:36:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 省省这些友情提示吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, spare me the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.99,0:36:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能杀死那贱人就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me at kill the bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.80,0:36:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 祝好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.73,0:36:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.97,0:36:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话我听多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.52,0:36:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.25,0:36:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.68,0:36:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.54,0:37:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那个该死的初刃藏哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you stash the damn blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.17,0:37:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有东西能摧毁初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can destroy the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.64,0:37:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把它藏在了大洋的最深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I threw it into the bottom of the deepest ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.93,0:37:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样我才能信守我对Colette的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way I can keep my promise to Colette.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.89,0:37:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到初刃 杀了Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find the blade.Kill Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.71,0:37:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是首先要答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But make me a promise first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.16,0:37:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤你的时候 我一定会召唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I call you, and I will call.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.16,0:37:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来找我 然后把刀用在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come find me, and use the blade on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.02,0:37:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.05,0:37:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我接下来要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what I'm about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.18,0:37:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都困在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all trapped in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.62,0:37:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}With him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.60,0:38:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.25,0:38:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.69,0:38:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣光的量太少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid there wasn't enough grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.12,0:38:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得用其它办法找Gadreel了 对不起 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to find Gadreel another way.I'm sorry, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.59,0:38:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.46,0:38:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.18,0:38:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的都对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.19,0:39:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该也抱住我才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's the part where you hug back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.88,0:39:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.71,0:39:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.73,0:39:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.18,0:39:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron是纠正一切的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron is the key to fixing everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.15,0:39:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该这样 我会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's wrong.I'm gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.81,0:39:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.69,0:39:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要动用一切帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use all the help we could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.58,0:39:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,来找到Gadreel和Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find Gadreel and Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.67,0:39:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.42,0:39:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.30,0:39:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你值得拥有那个标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.51,0:39:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 你也开始煽情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, now you're gonna get all touchy feely too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.38,0:40:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的问题 在于你是世界上最恨你自己的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your problem, is that nobody hates you more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.94,0:40:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.81,0:40:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么找这个初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find this blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.53,0:40:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能搜遍所有的海底 但是我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't search the bottom of the ocean, but I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.69,0:40:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到它 然后把它送到它新主人的手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll find it, and bring it to its new owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.16,0:40:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都看到了 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.93,0:40:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在Cain家的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at Cain's.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你除了那个攻击你的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dusted that undercard demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.16,0:40:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就坐在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you just sat back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.75,0:40:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,旁观了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And watched the main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.40,0:40:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.76,0:40:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道印记的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.15,0:40:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道Abaddon和Cain的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew Abaddon and Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.58,0:40:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道所有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.64,0:40:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你耍了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you played me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.39,0:40:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.59,0:40:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远不会把初刃给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would never have given me the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.47,0:40:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是谁会对你说不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can say no to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.71,0:40:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让你演下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed you to play along.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.43,0:40:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们被跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew we were being followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.63,0:40:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.80,0:40:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cain想让我们看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Cain would want we were to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.90,0:40:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,重归战场\N{\fnArial\fs30}His prize fighter up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.71,0:41:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你加恶魔 等于 不战不归夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You plus demons equals fight night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.58,0:41:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tara死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara died.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.38,0:41:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.63,0:41:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋卷 打鸡蛋 等等等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Omelets.Broken eggs.etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.31,0:41:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀了Ababddon之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I killed Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.45,0:41:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.08,0:41:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话不是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.14,0:41:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起多欢乐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having too much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.54,0:41:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 就算有了初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up, even with the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.81,0:41:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也得用尽所有能用的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.28,0:41:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来对付Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}To against Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.48,0:41:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找初刃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.81,0:41:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两兄弟之间总要有点儿事 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always something with you boys, isn't it.
